# Nova AI — Frontend Wire-Up Plan

> **Stack**: Vite + React + React Router + Axios  
> **Backend**: FastAPI on `http://localhost:8000`  
> **Goal**: Wire the existing UI pages to the real backend to create a fully working AI SaaS product.

