## Backend API Reference (The Truth)

### Authentication — `/authentication`
| Action | Method | URL | Payload | Returns |
|--------|--------|-----|---------|---------|
| Sign Up | `POST` | `/authentication/signup` | `{email, password}` | `{message}` |
| Login | `POST` | `/authentication/login` | `form: username, password` | `{access_token, token_type}` |

### Summarization — `/summarization`
| Action | Method | URL | Payload | Returns |
|--------|--------|-----|---------|---------|
| Upload PDF | `POST` | `/summarization/pdf` | `FormData: file, length, language` | **Streaming text** |
| Summarize URL | `POST` | `/summarization/url` | `{url, length, language}` | **Streaming text** |
| Summarize YouTube | `POST` | `/summarization/youtube_url` | `{url, length, language}` | **Streaming text** |
| Summarize Text | `POST` | `/summarization/text` | `{text, length, language}` | **Streaming text** |
| Delete Document | `DELETE` | `/summarization/documents/{id}` | — | `{message}` |
| **[TO ADD]** List Documents | `GET` | `/summarization/documents` | — | `[{id, name, type, created_at}]` |

### RAG Features — `/qa`
| Action | Method | URL | Payload | Returns |
|--------|--------|-----|---------|---------|
| Ask Question | `POST` | `/qa/ask` | `{question, document_id}` | **Streaming text** |
| Generate Quiz | `POST` | `/qa/quiz?document_id={id}` | `{difficulty}` | `Quiz JSON` |
| Generate Notes | `POST` | `/qa/notes?document_id={id}` | `{length, language}` | **Streaming text** |

> [!WARNING]
> Streaming endpoints CANNOT use axios. You MUST use the native `fetch()` API with `response.body.getReader()`.

