## Phase 4 — Auth Flow

### `AuthPage.jsx` Wiring

```javascript
// Login
const data = await api.login(email, password);
localStorage.setItem('nova_token', data.access_token);
navigate('/dashboard');

// Signup
await api.signup(email, password);
// Switch to login view

// Logout (in any component)
localStorage.removeItem('nova_token');
navigate('/');
```

