## Phase 5 — Dashboard Wiring

The Dashboard shows the user's document library.

```javascript
// On mount
useEffect(() => {
  const docs = await api.getDocuments();
  setDocuments(docs);
}, []);

// Upload PDF
const reader = await api.uploadPdf(file, length, language);
await readStream(reader, chunk => setSummary(p => p + chunk), () => {
  // Refresh document list after upload
  const docs = await api.getDocuments();
  setDocuments(docs);
});

// Delete
await api.deleteDocument(doc.id);
setDocuments(prev => prev.filter(d => d.id !== doc.id));
```

